    <item>
      <title>Instrumentation</title>
      <link>https://spmbitphys.github.io/instrumentation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://spmbitphys.github.io/instrumentation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate and maintain several facilities, including: one 1K-8T STM-AFM system, two 4K STM systems with MBE chambers，Three UHV-MBE systems, one RT AFM-MFM system, one RT STM system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;stmafm&#34;&gt;STM/AFM&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;align-center justify-caption&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://spmbitphys.github.io/images/instrumentation/Quanta.jpg#center&#34;
         alt=&#34;This is a customer design STM with 1.2 K lowest temperature and 8 T magnetic field. It also capable of surface magnetism imaging with SP-STM mode as well as molecular bonds imaging with nc-AFM mode. Beside, two HF lines arrive at the tunneling junction with MW frequency larger than 20 GHz.&#34; width=&#34;800&#34;/&gt; &lt;figcaption&gt;
            Quanta&lt;p&gt;This is a customer design STM with 1.2 K lowest temperature and 8 T magnetic field. It also capable of surface magnetism imaging with SP-STM mode as well as molecular bonds imaging with nc-AFM mode. Beside, two HF lines arrive at the tunneling junction with MW frequency larger than 20 GHz.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
